# NOTE: App/App/public (the built staff web bundle) is intentionally COMMITTED.
# The Scheduler app is archived LOCALLY in Xcode, and this folder is what ships
# inside the .app. Keeping it gitignored meant a fresh clone / git pull never
# carried the up-to-date bundle, so local archives silently shipped stale staff
# screens (burned builds 6/7/8). Committing it means `git pull` → Archive always
# ships current. Rebuild it with `npm run build:scheduler && BONBOX_TARGET=scheduler npx cap sync ios`
# whenever the staff frontend changes, and commit the result.

# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
